[1851.488399, "o", "[07:54:22] ✅ Complete edge_request_filter_cpu_saturation: results={'Diagnosis': {'judgment': 'False', 'reasoning': 'Verdict:    main.py:664\r\n           False (composite=0.00). D1 Fault Localization: 0.00 | D2 Fault Characterization: 0.00 | D3 Scope Precision: 0.00.                \r\n           Weakest dimension: Fault Localization (0.00). Checklist details: [{\"id\": \"D1-Q1\", \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\":                    \r\n           \"Diagnosis blames the email service, not the frontend-proxy component.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\": \"D1-Q2\",                  \r\n           \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Diagnosis attributes fault to email service, whereas ground truth fault originates in               \r\n           frontend-proxy.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\": \"D1-Q3\", \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Email service is identified as             \r\n           faulty, but ground truth says frontend-proxy is healthy.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\": \"D2-Q1\", \"answer\": \"No\",                \r\n           \"evidence\": \"Diagnosis cites a thread\\\\u2011pool limit, not the WAF regex rule injection.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"},               \r\n           {\"id\": \"D2-Q2\", \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Provides details about Puma threads, not the mutated regex pattern.\",               \r\n           \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\": \"D2-Q3\", \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Attributes fault to thread\\\\u2011pool                        \r\n           misconfiguration, which conflicts with regex backtracking cause.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\": \"D3-Q1\", \"answer\":              \r\n           \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Blames email service, a component not mentioned in ground truth.\", \"confidence\": \"High\"}, {\"id\":              \r\n           \"D3-Q2\", \"answer\": \"No\", \"evidence\": \"Does not mention frontend\\\\u2011proxy, the only component in ground truth.\